Major parts
A Message broker with single queue and atleast once guarantee.

1. Thread safe queues
    ShreniQueue implements IShreniQueue, that is safe for queueing messages and dequeuing
        1. ConcurrentQueue<Queueitem> mainQueue // this is drained by QueueDrainer
        2. ConcurrentHashSet<messageId> ackedMessages // this contains messages which are acked but not removed from the inflight queue
        3. ConcurrentQueue<Queueitem> inFlightQueue //parked here if sent but not acked. Will be requeued if not acked with in {x} seconds.
            when message is dequeued,
                it's added to inFlightQueue
                When a message is acked it's id is stored in ackedmessages set
                We have a MessageRedeliveryManager that wakes up every minute and checks first message i.e oldest and check

                if it's acked
                    if yes,
                        atomic{we remove it from inflight queue and ackedMessage queue}
                else
                    did we hit ackTimeout for this message
                        if yes we see if it can be redelivered
                            if yes, we requeue it to main queue
                        else, we add it to dead letter queue
                    else
                        this is oldest inflight message and we didn't hit acktimeout, so there is no need check other messages for ack timeout in the queue
                        let's break for now and recheck things in next cycle.

        4. ConcurrentSet<Subscriber> subscribersList;
        5. ConcurrentQueue<QueueItem> deadQueue;

