AuthFrame
4 byte -> frame length
1 byte : frame type -> Auth, AuthAck, PubContent, PubAck, SubContent, SubAck
2 bytes:  username length;
N bytes: username; utf-8 string
2 bytes: password length;
N bytes: password; utf-8 string;
1 byte: publisher/subscriber
16 bytes: clientId; uuid
16 bytes: subId/pubId; uuid
1 byte eof marker

AuthResponseFrame:
4 byte -> frame length
1 byte : frame type -> Auth, AuthAck, PubContent, PubAck, SubContent, SubAck
1 byte: Response code; {AuthSuccessful, AuthFailed, clientIdNotAllowed, unexpectedFrame}
1 byte eof marker


